{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Ca3YdPRiGQT9bhgK68bXcf","type":"tool_result","content":"## The attribution\n## What this changes\n## The rule this produces\n## Status — 1.0 is done, and the term it removed came off the measured slope\n## Status — 1.2 is done too, and it found a term the profile could not see\n## Status — 1.3 did not move this term, and that is the entry\n## Status — 1.5 is done, and it is the first kernel win since 1.2\n## What is left of the term\n=== negative-results sections ===\n12:## 1. The most expensive lesson: a fake +28 % that passed every gate\n33:## 2. Retired by measurement\n52:## 3. The negatives that were really instrumentation failures\n71:## 4. Conditionally retired — re-open after the draft-head fine-tune\n88:## 4b. Killed inside the winning iteration — the radix top-k's two dead levers (ladder 1.2, 2026-08-20)\n119:## 4c. Adopted, bit-exact, and worth nothing — the `lim <= topk` early-out (ladder 1.3, 2026-08-20)\n154:## 4d. Superseded before it shipped — the tiled `index_score`, and the cost of picking the wrong reference (ladder 1.5, 2026-08-20)\n195:## 5. What the negatives taught","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"f3675501-4e06-40a6-a91c-c3ec4ba4cfd0","uuid":"ec2a36ed-f58b-490d-9313-9d6470ccdf0d","timestamp":"2026-08-20T15:08:06.942Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"## The attribution\n## What this changes\n## The rule this produces\n## Status — 1.0 is done, and the term it removed came off the measured slope\n## Status — 1.2 is done too, and it found a term the profile could not see\n## Status — 1.3 did not move this term, and that is the entry\n## Status — 1.5 is done, and it is the first kernel win since 1.2\n## What is left of the term\n=== negative-results sections ===\n12:## 1. The most expensive lesson: a fake +28 % that passed every gate\n33:## 2. Retired by measurement\n52:## 3. The negatives that were really instrumentation failures\n71:## 4. Conditiona